+## Why
+
+Task #2356 must turn the accepted B1 immutable snapshot and B2 fenced queue into a complete downloadable PDF. The Luxembourg article currently exceeds the browser path's 50,000-character limit; a complete diagnostic PDF does not provide durable website delivery.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Integrate the exact published canonical F1 artifact through bounded, restartable planning and rendering commands. Preserve all selected text, media placements, themes, settings and original snapshot bytes.
+- Persist each measured single-page PDF and independently verify its receipt before an epoch-fenced checkpoint.
+- Compose a complete file on private disk, with actual page counts, front matter, global folios, TOC destinations, bookmarks, page labels and metadata.
+- Issue short-lived job-scoped download tickets and stream authenticated or ticket-authorized downloads with current ACL checks.
+- Expose PDF capability only when exact artifact/runtime/profile capacity evidence and complete publication certificates pass.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+- `exports/book-pdf-publication`: durable canonical full-PDF production, certification and private ticket delivery.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+None. Existing B1 selection and B2 lifecycle requirements remain authoritative.
+
+## Impact
+
+Owned implementation areas: book_exports renderer/composer/tickets/publication/views/observation; tests/book_exports; opt-in worker runtime/container configuration and docs/book-exports. No migration or async-model change is currently planned. Node/Playwright/Chromium and a bounded disk composer are isolated worker dependencies, never web-app rendering dependencies.
+
+## Non-goals
+
+No alternate Python templates, truncation, ZIP/mandatory volumes, cap increase, editorial changes, native large sharing or infrastructure/nginx changes. The foreign add-durable-book-export-queue draft is untouched.
+
+## Frontend impact
+
+Verified read-only mirror HEAD=origin/main c98e6b7c834e876b167ec41afdb4a7323d63ad0f. api/bookExports.ts and export hooks consume capabilities/status/tickets in existing #2357; legacy limits are removed only through accepted #2358. F1 #2354 must first add durable planning and exact measured-PDF persistence and publish a new reviewed artifact; whole runWorker/planBody is not one B2 portion.
+
+## Deployment and acceptance
+
+Shared production deployment and actual complete-file/capacity/ACL acceptance are part of #2356. The human directly authorized this card on 2026-10-10; the root session follows the frontend AGENTS direct-backend exception, explicit master commits/push and canonical Compose-v2 rollout. Keep this OpenSpec active and task unfinished until exact deployed revision and bounded evidence pass. ARM64 local feasibility is explicitly not production AMD64 capacity evidence.
