+- [ ] 5.4 Accept full real Luxembourg PDF and complete1000/5000 workloads under unchangedB2 profile with all descendant/composer peaks and external numerical app-health observation.
+- [ ] 5.5 Accept production cancellation/restart/retry/revoke/expiry/cleanup, physical complete-file navigation and scoped streaming download; F2/F3 coordination remains on existing cards.
+- [ ] 5.6 Only after all requirements pass: strict OpenSpec validation, sync canonical specs, archive and explicit-path reviewed docs commit; record original-card Done evidence.
